%%{init: {'theme': 'neutral', 'themeVariables': { 'fontSize': '13px'}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor 用户 as U
    participant 微信小程序 as MP
    participant AppAIController as AC
    participant AdminAssistantService as SVC
    participant IClGoodsService as GS
    participant OllamaService as OLL
    participant Ollama as LLM
    participant MySQL as DB

    U->>MP: 输入问题
    MP->>AC: POST /api/app/ai/chat
    AC->>SVC: chat(deviceId, question)
    SVC->>GS: 查询上架商品摘要
    GS->>DB: SELECT cl_goods
    DB-->>GS: 上架商品行
    GS-->>SVC: 商品列表文本
    SVC->>SVC: 组装 System Prompt
    SVC->>OLL: HTTP 调用可设超时
    OLL->>LLM: 推理
    alt 成功
        LLM-->>OLL: 回答文本
        OLL-->>SVC: answer
    else 超时或故障
        OLL-->>SVC: 异常
        SVC->>SVC: 降级固定话术<br/>推荐列表为空
    end
    SVC->>SVC: 模糊匹配商品名
    SVC->>DB: INSERT cl_ai_chat_log
    SVC-->>AC: answer + recommendedGoods
    AC-->>MP: AjaxResult
    MP-->>U: 气泡与商品卡片
